[[Screamingclaw]] is a [[Desert Griffon]] [[monk]] [[boss]] that appears in [[Prophet's Path]].
He wanders in a little pocket just southwest of [[Augury Rock]]. Usually Screamingclaw is accompanied by a pair of [[Desert Griffon]]s, with another a little farther away. Sometimes [[Featherfist]] or a Desert Griffon may spawn in the same spot instead.

